an></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R55r2:"><div data-rid="503f2750-ff97-48ef-9672-96aeb5249b3e" class="r-1cslwbg"><div data-rid="3cb0f17a-99d0-49e7-89a1-a175fbba303f" class="r-1qzcyj7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Multivitamin is suitable for dogs of all ages and breeds. However, we do recommend dogs begin to incorporate the chews into their daily routine starting at an age of 3 months or older.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0427d506-3ea7-4bb6-897c-4b1dd286421d" class="r-scxwin" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d9904054-b033-490a-b575-b5806fe295e2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R75r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-hozrii"><div data-rid="6517118a-5fb5-4ce5-9e36-c0b3686d7702" class="r-1hdozcz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What does 100% Human-Grade mean? </p></span></div><div data-rid="34aec81e-8690-4489-bc1b-169b6530b45e" class="r-17v2t48"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R75r2:"><div data-rid="25b68a08-79f9-4cd9-b517-89252aa1f161" class="r-1xir2mm"><div data-rid="767e3271-fc51-4ffb-9fbf-a9e585ef7c5f" class="r-fvfa3a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most pet supplements from other brands contain palm oil, fillers, artificial flavoring, preservatives, etc. At VitalPaws, we’re raising the standards of pet health by only using the highest quality human-grade ingredients, which is what our best friends deserve.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="251b76e2-9a52-4c6a-9a44-817033ad1baf" class="r-ode2hq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="59ebcfcf-7ff5-42e8-9966-527af854bae7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R95r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-udhh2l"><div data-rid="7171c105-9f8c-43c0-b804-a351669f1e9c" class="r-k7wa7o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long until I start seeing the benefits?</p></span></div><div data-rid="9272c13e-9c3c-464a-a2e4-2e5551d7be43" class="r-97l6bk"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R95r2:"><div data-rid="318b6dd6-4d6c-4ea1-ab06-152e863d7343" class="r-o5znsx"><div data-rid="c0778bc3-c283-4c9f-8f0d-1555d13b5eb9" class="r-4gjadf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="77f960f0-8c2e-4c8d-acd2-9fb0c7fdc404" class="r-x8fy5q" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="15be34f8-0d18-45bd-8f7f-6b7ae2266ccf" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rb5r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-jp9x0a"><div data-rid="2c6ffc47-6350-4486-8462-95399284eed6" class="r-1slqodb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How many chews come in a jar? </p></span></div><div data-rid="c4c9af56-0801-4afc-bb78-804c10aa55fa" class="r-ewuxtn"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rb5r2:"><div data-rid="a0dde080-fd7e-4c25-abf5-684bc59d33ff" class="r-j9514v"><div data-rid="e9f1e418-955e-473a-950b-0626e9d40e59" class="r-2imioc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There are <strong>60 Chews in each jar</strong>, which is a 2-month supply for Small Dogs (0-12kg). <br>Medium dogs (12-34kg) will need a monthly frequency. <br>Bigger dogs (34kg+) will need a 3-weekly frequency.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b55dcd0d-7f4e-4e7b-80fc-840c0fc2e35e" class="r-1n8jpf2" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="78152afa-978c-4d5a-b76d-ba10f0511a40" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rd5r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1mwajbx"><div data-rid="a0c47c4f-06fe-4325-861c-6e07355397b5" class="r-10nwke1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What flavour is the Multivitamin?</p></span></div><div data-rid="923308f1-4ade-4263-9b04-566cf1e02ef8" class="r-1fvyhnp"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rd5r2:"><div data-rid="06c0b4ee-fb06-4598-bf80-09e3d8f9ede1" class="r-1evgbej"><div data-rid="37feb6d4-4d4f-421d-a38e-57fdf289d503" class="r-1xhovd0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade chicken liver, a flavor that dogs absolutely love. In the case of a chicken allergy, we recommend our Beef flavour!</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="40082114-890e-4dc0-a827-3d418f49649c" class="r-yyl8hx" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="fe0403c7-f451-4e1a-98bd-1ebe479a1a08" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rf5r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-nh7thz"><div data-rid="14a20a2a-05ea-47a5-8db9-f70fc3c07974" class="r-1gg3nl1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews? </p></span></div><div data-rid="137a0158-8341-4fdc-a820-7b06de920b9f" class="r-k98gjb"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rf5r2:"><div data-rid="86932060-88cc-496f-81ec-5fc8192e32f9" class="r-uaf4wl"><div data-rid="6df2e0c9-4915-4e5b-b808-81435ef54ce7" class="r-m6okb7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="28a0974c-fd4d-4dfa-877f-591862d74c15" class="r-b9gk5p" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2d5ad7dc-7252-4a78-b244-5b629a9b5c17" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rh5r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-z7floe"><div data-rid="d315d68f-e0e2-47fb-b260-ad3a40ccdd04" class="r-5t210g alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements? </p></span></div><div data-rid="d8c6492d-95a5-4519-b3b6-bb104daf6fd0" class="r-js76bs"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rh5r2:"><div data-rid="ddf3b93a-95f7-4fe4-9dee-76349b7b0d11" class="r-1x6ms3l"><div data-rid="d1f96eda-368c-4b11-b996-b66a93b223f6" class="r-1vwrh9k alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
